{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f9fcad22-e1a8-861c-8314-18bce4120168",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:02:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Timothy Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:00:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:00:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes, my name is Timothy Lawton. I am calling about my water and sewer bill. It is too high? I think it is wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:00:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Lawton, let's take a look. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:00:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "294 Narragansett Avenue. Um, wait. I have two properties. Let me check. [pause] Yes, this bill is for the other one. No, sorry. It is this one, 294. I mix the two papers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:00:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, it happens. So 294 Narragansett. What looks off to you on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:00:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The usage is very big this quarter. Almost double. We were not home much. And no leak, I checked. I think the charge is not right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:01:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Sometimes a reading is estimated and then a real reading catches up, and that makes one bill jump. I can see the bill but I can't tell from here if the meter reading was off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:01:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would like a supervisor to review this charge, please. Can you do that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:01:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can send it up to a supervisor to review the reading. Is this the best number to reach you, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:01:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, but please call before three. I clean offices on weeknights, so I go to work soon. After that I cannot answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:01:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, I'll note to call in the afternoon before three. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:01:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One more question. Is there any discount for low income, or for elderly people? My mother is older, she has a bill also, but it is different account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:01:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the details on that in front of me, so I'll have the supervisor's office go over it with you when they call. Is your mother's account the one at the other property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:02:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the other one. Not this one. I am sorry, I mix it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:02:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're all set, Mr. Lawton. We'll go over both accounts when they call. Have a good shift."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:02:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Bye."
    }
  ],
